Kabhii Tumhhe Guitar Chords with strumming pattern easy lesson with and without capo from Bollywood Hindi movie Shershah sung by Darshan Raval.

Strumming Pattern: D UDUD DDDU OR DD UUUD

<code>Version 1:

[Gm]Tum Agar [F]Manaoge,        Toh [Dm]Maan Jaun [D#]ga
[Gm]Main Tere [F]Bulane Pe,        [Dm]Laut Aaun [D#]ga
[A#]Har Safar Mein [Cm]Sath Tera,        Main [F]Yun Hi Nibhaun [Gm]ga

[Gm]Kabhii Tumhhe Yaad [F]Meri Aaye,        [Dm]Palko Se Zulf [D#]Hata Lena
[Gm]Saaf Dikhunga Main [F]Tumko Wahin,        [Dm]Jo Na Dikhun Toh [D#]Bata Dena

[Gm]Kabhi Mujhe Der Jo [F]Ho Jaaye,        [Dm]Wakt Ko Thoda [D#]Bacha Lena
[Gm]Phir Se Milunga Main [F]Tumko Wahin,        [Dm]Jo Na Milun Toh [D#]Saza Dena

[Gm]Meri Zameen Ko [F]Tere Kadam Ka,        [Dm]Na Jaane Kab Se [D#]Tha Intezaar
[Gm]Ek Na Ek Din [F]Aana Hai Tumko,        [Dm]Dil Ko Mere Hai Yeh [D#]Aitbaar

[A#]Main Khuda Se [Cm]Tere Siwa,        Kuchh [F]Aur Na Magun [Gm]ga

[Gm]Kabhii Tumhhe Yaad [F]Meri Aaye,        [Dm]Itni Si Baat Sam [D#]ajh Jaana
[Gm]Phir Se Milunga Main [F]Tumko Wahin,        [Dm]Raah Se Meri [D#]Guzar Jaana</code>

<!-- Post Middle -->

<code>Version 2:

