[G]Har Safar Mein [Am]Saath Tera,        Main [D]Yoon Hi Nibhaun [Em]ga

[Em]Kabhi Tumhe Yaad [D]Meri Aaye,        [Bm]Palkon Se Zulfein [C]Hata Lena
[Em]Saaf Dikhunga Main [D]Tumko Wahin,        [Bm]Jo Na Dikhun To [C]Bata Dena
[Em]Kabhi Mujhe Der Jo [D]Ho Jaaye,        [Bm]Waqt Ko Thoda [C]Bacha Lena
[Em]Phir Se Milunga Main [D]Tumko Wahin,        [Bm]Jo Na Milun To [C]Saza Dena

[Em]Meri Zamin Ko,        [D]Tere Kadam Ka
[Bm]Na Jaane Kab Se,        [C]Tha Intezar
[Em]Ek Na Ek Din,        [D]Aana Hai Tumko
[Bm]Dil Ko Mere Hai [C]Yeh Aitbar,        [G]Main Khuda Se [Am]Tere Siwa
Kuchh [D]Aur Na Magoon [Em]ga

[Em]Kabhi Tumhe Yaad [D]Meri Aaye,        [Bm]Itni Si Baat [C]Samajh Jana
[Em]Phir Se Milunga Main [D]Tumko Wahin,        [Bm]Raah Se Meri [C]Ghuzar Jana</code>
